From 57577d7f5ad851ca166fd259da4a4278700e2276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:51:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(motion): lathe Facing faces the stock's allowance
 above a finished part

turning::facing now takes the setup's stock beside the part: the axis
is still fitted to the part, but the ladder climbs to the stock's end
and the bands and rapids radius read the stock too. A bar's facing
allowance declared in the stock is faced to the part's end instead of
"nothing to face"; with neither stock nor part above the plane the
refusal names both.

Fixes #122

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
