Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(app): facing golden starts outside the raw bar; the
 work-offset law moves the stock too

The lathe facing golden's passes now start at diameter 13.6 (the r6
bar stock + the 0.8 nose) instead of 11.6 (the r5 neck + nose, inside
the raw bar); every other line is unchanged. The spindle law's
"moved work offset posts the same program" fixture moves its box stock
with the bar and G54, since facing now reads the stock.

Refs #122

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
